      <title>小米18 Fold官宣徕卡三摄：2亿主摄加Summilux如何塞进折叠机身</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/geek001/post/20260903/%E5%B0%8F%E7%B1%B318-Fold%E5%AE%98%E5%AE%A3%E5%BE%95%E5%8D%A1%E4%B8%89%E6%91%842%E4%BA%BF%E4%B8%BB%E6%91%84%E5%8A%A0Summilux%E5%A6%82%E4%BD%95%E5%A1%9E%E8%BF%9B%E6%8A%98%E5%8F%A0%E6%9C%BA%E8%BA%AB/</link>
